We’ll do our best to get back to you as soon as we can. If you need immediate support, we recommend you call us on +1 800 227 0290 (Toll free within USA only) or email us on qffreightusa@qantas.com.au adding your case number in the subject line.


Thanks for your patience,
The Qantas Freight Team

